<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>How<sp/>Methods<sp/>Are<sp/>Dispatched</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>Incoming<sp/>framed<sp/>protobuf<sp/>packets<sp/>are<sp/>decoded<sp/>by<sp/>`tp_methods_handle()`<sp/>in<sp/>@ref<sp/>tp_methods.h.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>The<sp/>dispatcher<sp/>switches<sp/>on<sp/>the<sp/>generated<sp/>nanopb<sp/>oneof<sp/>tag<sp/>and<sp/>calls<sp/>the<sp/>corresponding<sp/>handler<sp/>from<sp/>this<sp/>group.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>Handlers<sp/>validate<sp/>arguments,<sp/>perform<sp/>hardware<sp/>actions<sp/>through<sp/>@ref<sp/>common<sp/>&quot;common&quot;<sp/>helpers<sp/>and<sp/>TinyProbe<sp/>drivers,<sp/>and<sp/>return<sp/>a<sp/>generated<sp/>status<sp/>code.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
